# Reading order: what is fixed, then each stretch counted back from it, then the whole line.
# four-hundred-and-eighty-years.md is a draft, and hooks/draft_pages.py drops drafts from the
# build, so naming it here fails `mkdocs build --strict`. Add it after chronology-anchors.md in
# the commit that publishes it.
nav:
  - index.md
  - chronology-anchors.md
  - why-not-4004-bc.md
  - flood-and-the-king-lists.md
  - genealogy-times.md
  - combined-timeline.md
  - ...
